/S /P
/P 390 0 R
/E (The use of the LED in this power supply enhances usability by immediately showing whether the 9V and 12V outputs are available. This is especially important during testing and troubleshooting of electronic circuits. In summary, the 1.5V LED is a small but essential component that contributes to the overall reliability, safety, and user-friendliness of the regulated power supply system.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
